WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.185
Make programs choose a path and repeat useful work.

00:00:04.185 --> 00:00:08.415
Start total at zero and add each number produced by range(1, 8).

00:00:08.415 --> 00:00:09.825
The result is 28.

00:00:10.825 --> 00:00:13.875
How many values does range(2, 8, 2) produce?

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:16.163
It produces 2, 4 and 6.

00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:18.450
The stop value 8 is excluded.
